  "dur": 1.6
 },
 {
  "text": "We all learned that's the muscle range.",
  "start": 2.64,
  "dur": 2.43
 },
 {
  "text": "But research says 6 to 30 reps all build muscle.",
  "start": 5.78,
  "dur": 4.76
 },
 {
  "text": "On one condition.",
  "start": 11.3,
  "dur": 0.98
 },
 {
  "text": "Push the set until you've got 1 or 2 reps left.",
  "start": 13.04,
  "dur": 4.05
 },
 {
  "text": "Stop at 12 when you could do 20?",
